r future, there is only war. Experience every bone-rattling explosion and soul-crushing charge in Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector, the definitve battle-scale game of turn-based strategy and fast-paced combat that takes you to the battlefields of the 41st Millenium.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/warhammer-40000-battlesector", "videos": [{"id": 45545, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "ZIZILTdExNQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZIZILTdExNQ", "title": "Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector || Reveal Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZIZILTdExNQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 45546, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "jqMwiYClZmc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jqMwiYClZmc", "title": "Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector || Gameplay Reveal", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jqMwiYClZmc/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 114184, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "r3qv8jIZdoc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r3qv8jIZdoc", "title": "Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector - Official Update Overview Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/r3qv8jIZdoc/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 135105, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "A3SdYsW4Sp8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A3SdYsW4Sp8", "title": "Slitherine Next 2024 | Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector \u2013 Developers Talk", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/A3SdYsW4Sp8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 184381, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "aMRYNcqlU4Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aMRYNcqlU4Q", "title": "Warhammer 40,000: Battlesector - Free to Try | Warhammer Skulls 2026", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aMRYNcqlU4Q/fhddefault.jpg"}]}